{"speciesId":70,"names":{"fr":"Boustiflor","es":"Weepinbell","en":"Weepinbell","ja":"ウツドン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"It spits out POISONPOWDER to immobilize the enemy and then finishes it with a spray of ACID."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"It spits out POISONPOWDER to immobilize the enemy and then finishes it with a spray of ACID."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"When hungry, it swallows anything that moves. Its hapless prey is melted inside by strong acids."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Even though it is filled with ACID, it does not melt because it also oozes a neutral­ izing fluid."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"If its prey is bigger than its mouth, it slices up the victim with sharp leaves, then eats every morsel."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"When it's hungry, it swings its razor-sharp leaves, slicing up any unlucky object nearby for food."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"WEEPINBELL has a large hook on its rear end. At night, the POKéMON hooks on to a tree branch and goes to sleep. If it moves around in its sleep, it may wake up to find itself on the ground."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"WEEPINBELL has a large hook on its rear end. At night, the POKéMON hooks on to a tree branch and goes to sleep. If it moves around in its sleep, it may wake up to find itself on the ground."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"At night, a WEEPINBELL hangs on to a tree branch with its hooked rear and sleeps. If it moves around in its sleep, it may wake up to find itself on the ground."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The leafy parts act as cutters for slashing foes. It spits a fluid that dissolves everything."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It spits out POISONPOWDER to immobilize the enemy and then finishes it with a spray of ACID."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Even though it is filled with acid, it does not melt because it also oozes a protective fluid."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"If its prey is bigger than its mouth, it slices up the victim with sharp leaves, then eats every morsel."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon végétal. Il capture les proies étourdies en les endormant à l’aide d’une poudre toxique."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un Pokémon végétal. Il capture les proies étourdies en les endormant à l’aide d’une poudre toxique."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses membres en forme de feuilles permettent à Boustiflor de trancher ses adversaires. Il crache un fluide capable de tout dissoudre."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Las hojas que tiene actúan como cuchillas en combate. Otra de sus armas es el corrosivo fluido que expulsa."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The leafy parts act as cutters for slashing foes. It spits a fluid that dissolves everything."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"葉っぱの 部分は カッターになって 相手を 切り裂く。口からは なんでも 溶かす 液体を 吐く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il crache de la Poudre Toxik pour immobiliser sa proie et il l’achève avec de l’Acide."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Escupe Polvo Veneno para envenenar al enemigo y, luego, lo liquida con Ácido."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It spits out Poison Powder to immobilize the enemy and then finishes it with a spray of Acid."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"まず 毒の粉を 吐き 相手の 動きを 止めてしまってから 溶解液で とどめを 刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Boustiflor est doté d’un gros crochet. La nuit, ce Pokémon s’accroche à une branche pour s’endormir. Quand il a un sommeil agité, il se réveille par terre."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Weepinbell tiene un gancho a modo de extremidad superior trasera, que usa por la noche para colgarse de una rama y echarse a dormir. Si se mueve mientras duerme, puede acabar en el suelo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Weepinbell has a large hook on its rear end. At night, the Pokémon hooks on to a tree branch and goes to sleep. If it moves around in its sleep, it may wake up to find itself on the ground."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"夜に なると お尻の フックを 木の 枝に 引っ掛けて ぶら下がり 眠りに つく。 寝相が 悪いと 朝 落っこちているよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Boustiflor est doté d’un gros crochet. La nuit, ce Pokémon s’accroche à une branche pour s’endormir. Quand il a un sommeil agité, il se réveille par terre."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Weepinbell tiene un gancho a modo de extremidad superior trasera, que usa por la noche para colgarse de una rama y echarse a dormir. Si se mueve mientras duerme, puede acabar en el suelo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Weepinbell has a large hook on its rear end. At night, the Pokémon hooks on to a tree branch and goes to sleep. If it moves around in its sleep, it may wake up to find itself on the ground."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"夜に なると お尻の フックを 木の 枝に 引っ掛けて ぶら下がり 眠りに つく。 寝相が 悪いと 朝 落っこちているよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Quand il a faim, il avale tout ce qui bouge, puis achève ses proies avec de l’acide."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Cuando tiene hambre, engulle a todo lo que se mueve. La pobre presa acaba disuelta en sus ácidos."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"When hungry, it swallows anything that moves. Its hapless prey is dissolved by strong acids."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"お腹が 減ると 手あたり次第に 動くものを 飲みこんでは 溶解液で とどめを さす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Quand il a faim, il avale tout ce qui bouge, puis achève ses proies avec de l’acide."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Cuando tiene hambre, engulle a todo lo que se mueve. La pobre presa acaba disuelta en sus ácidos."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"When hungry, it swallows anything that moves. Its hapless prey is dissolved by strong acids."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"お腹が 減ると 手あたり次第に 動くものを 飲みこんでは 溶解液で とどめを さす。"}],"varieties":[{"id":70,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"slam","le